      "id": "Apple2e_Enhanced_Video.rom",
      "display": "Apple IIe video ROM",
      "description": "The 4 KB character generator of the (enhanced) Apple IIe: the text and MouseText glyphs the picture is made of. Both IIe models and the TK3000 //e draw with it. Apple's, and yours to supply. AppleWin's source tree carries it as resource/Apple2e_Enhanced_Video.rom.",
      "size": 4096,
      "sha1": "B2B5D87F52693817FC747DF087A4AA1DDCDB1F10",
      "name": "Apple2e_Enhanced_Video.rom",
      "requiredWhen": {
        "setting": "model",
        "in": [
          "apple2eEnhanced",
          "apple2e",
          "tk3000"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
